Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我是茱莉亚 欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}今天就由我来为您服务
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请过来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}小心脚滑哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}碰到你的胸部了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你该不会很紧张吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}是有一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.09,0:01:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请你放松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}今天就交给我就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}那我们现在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}就开始洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}会冰吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}开始涂了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.99,0:01:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}会痛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不会 刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}会痛的话要跟我说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你的身材真不错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请你赦松全身哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}现在帮你洗下半身哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}会不会太用力呢？\N不会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}肉棒好暖和哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请转过身好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.03,0:03:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}现在帮你洗屁股哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.99,0:03:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:03:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}肉棒变硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}越来越硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我可以靠近一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}蛋蛋也很舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要不要换个洗法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请稍等我一会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.57,0:05:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.12,0:06:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}很舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可以做更舒服的按摩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你先转过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}中间一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}就是用那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我知道了 就洗那里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我要冲了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}身体清爽多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.69,0:09:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请转过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你的胸部好大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}就用这个胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}来做更舒服的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.25,0:09:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}感觉怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}乳头站起来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}现在来弄按摩最敏感的部位吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好暖和啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}等我一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:26.97,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样你会舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}很滑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}滑滑的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}龟头也来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}变的更热了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好厉害 变红了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要不要用更软的部位做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.74,0:12:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请站过来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好软哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好软哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.12,0:12:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.59,0:12:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服的按摩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}肉棒戳进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可以用嘴帮我做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.38,0:13:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}嘴巴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}只有今天特别帮你做哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}变硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这边也来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}变热了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我的龟头很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.33,0:17:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你喜欢用力一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.07,0:18:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}射出来没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要射了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.23,0:19:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}射了好多哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我帮你把剩下的挤出来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好棒…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}射了这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不好意思哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.31,0:20:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我帮你擦干净哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不好意思哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}还要你做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}只要你能射出来就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}觉得舒畅多了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}全身都舒畅多了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.23,0:21:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}欢迎光临 我是茱莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.53,0:21:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请多指教了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.07,0:22:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我现在就开始帮你按摩哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}请躺下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.95,0:22:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可以涂精油吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}从脚部开始哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}会痛的要跟我说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.71,0:22:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}很舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.52,0:22:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样会痛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}不会 很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.53,0:22:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这里是很重要的部位
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.27,0:23:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}帮你按摩跨下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}会痒的话请跟栽说哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:24:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我帮你擦一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.94,0:24:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}那太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.42,0:24:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}你真敏感呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.02,0:24:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我有点紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.31,0:24:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}还有一些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.32,0:25:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}要不要再来一次呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.53,0:25:09.72,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}我现在还很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}可以温柔一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.67,0:25:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}温柔一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.69,0:25:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}变的很硬了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.38,0:25:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.59,0:26:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}又变硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.20,0:26:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}有汁流出来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.03,0:26:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}这样如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.10,0:26:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.72,0:27:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}明明才刚射出来过\N这么快又有精神啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.53,0:27:20.52,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}现在很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.95,0:27:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.35,0:27:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0010,,{\fnSTKaiti\fs24\b1}滑滑的
